.el .ds Aq '
.TH iron-vault-lock 1  "Iron Vault" "Iron Vault Manual"
.SH NAME
iron\-vault\-lock \- Clear the vault identity and every cached secret from the service\*(Aqs memory, leaving it Locked. The lock lasts across restarts: run `unlock` to end it
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBiron\-vault lock\fR [\fB\-\-admin\-socket\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Clear the vault identity and every cached secret from the service\*(Aqs memory, leaving it Locked. The lock lasts across restarts: run `unlock` to end it
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-admin\-socket\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Use the admin socket at PATH instead of this installation\*(Aqs, for example one forwarded over SSH. Every client command takes it; `serve` refuses it, because the service always binds its own installation\*(Aqs socket
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
